_after":"三国吴置溇中县。晋因之，属天门郡。刘宋元嘉十八年，天门蛮...","context_before":"...。唐初因之。麟德元年，以崇义并入慈利。○溇中城，在县西。","source_end_index":161,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"18979ce4-0d1c-5c45-b06a-293ed486af32","source_start_index":135,"source_text":"后汉建初三年，武陵溇中蛮反。五年，荆豫诸郡兵讨平之。"}],"path":"湖广方舆纪要/六、岳州府（卷七十七）","source_name":"读史方舆纪要"}],"class_tags":["军事"],"content":"2荊、豫諸郡兵討漊中蠻，破之。","content_fanyi":"荆州、豫州各郡的军队征讨溇中蛮，将其击破。","content_jianti_auto":"2荆、豫诸郡兵讨溇中蛮，破之。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":3681,"number":2,"reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":1,"tongjian_id":"95416fe6-db0e-11ef-bf58-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"賢","people_name_jianti_auto":"贤","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"95416fed-db0e-11ef-9c4a-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"賢曰：遲，猶希望也，音持二翻。側席，謂不正坐，所以待賢良也。","note_content_jianti_auto":"贤曰：迟，犹希望也，音持二翻。侧席，谓不正坐，所以待贤良也。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":24,"tongjian_id":"95416fec-db0e-11ef-87f2-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"句斷。省，悉景翻。","note_content_jianti_auto":"句断。省，悉景翻。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":57,"tongjian_id":"95416fef-db0e-11ef-a60a-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[{"confidence":0.9,"official_category":"地方行政","official_name":"外官","official_note":"外官泛指在京城以外任职的官员，与内官相对，此处指地方官职空缺，可以补任。","official_rank":"未知","source_snippet":"今外官多曠","start_index":78,"tongjian_id":"98a0d04d-07f9-42ec-ba69-456697980ff5"}],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"link_td_description":"尧，祁姓，名放勋，中国神话中五帝之一，传说出生于三阿之南。道教中为天官大帝，三官大帝之一，诞日为上元节。","link_td_id":"Q10000026","link_td_number_id":14183,"people_name":"堯","people_name_jianti_auto":"尧","people_xingming":"尧","start_index":65,"tongjian_id":"95416ff0-db0e-11ef-a0f6-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[],"class_tags":["人事"],"content":"3夏，五月，辛亥，詔曰：「朕思遲直士，側席異聞，其先至者，各已發憤吐懣，略聞子大夫之志矣。皆欲置於左右，顧問省納。建武詔書又曰：『堯試臣以職，不直以言語筆札。』今外官多曠，並可以補任。」","content_fanyi":"夏季，五月初三日辛亥，汉章帝下诏说：“朕思念盼望正直的士人，侧席而坐听取不同的意见，其中先到的人都已经各自抒发愤懑、倾吐心声，朕也略微听到了诸位贤士大夫的志向。朕想把他们都安置在朕的左右，以备顾问、审察和采纳。光武帝建武年间的诏书又说：‘尧用实际职务来考察臣下，不只是凭言语和书信。’如今地方官职多有空缺，都可以补授任用。”","content_jianti_auto":"3夏，五月，辛亥，诏曰：「朕思迟直士，侧席异闻，其先至者，各已发愤吐懑，略闻子大夫之志矣。皆欲置于左右，顾问省纳。建武诏书又曰：『尧试臣以职，不直以言语笔札。』今外官多旷，并可以补任。」","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":3682,"number":3,"reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":2,"tongjian_id":"95416feb-db0e-11ef-a687-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[{"confidence":0.95,"official_category":"中枢机构","official_name":"太傅","official_note":"太傅是汉代三公之一，负责辅佐皇帝和教育太子，此处表示赵熹担任此职并去世。","official_rank":"正一品","source_snippet":"太傅趙熹薨","start_index":3,"tongjian_id":"f118b6cb-7b29-4afb-be71-95347c617276"}],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"link_birth_year":-4,"link_death_year":80,"link_td_description":"赵憙，字伯阳，南阳郡宛县（今河南南阳）人，东汉初期大臣。","link_td_id":"Q10002792","link_td_number_id":1556313,"people_name":"趙熹","people_name_jianti_auto":"赵熹","people_xingming":"赵熹","start_index":6,"tongjian_id":"95416ff2-db0e-11ef-87ca-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[],"class_tags":["人事"],"content":"4戊辰，太傅趙熹薨。","content_fanyi":"五月二十日戊辰，太傅赵熹去世。","content_jianti_auto"